# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Demand Answers alternate artifact-sacrifice or discard cost choice.
# Forcing: One artifact and one other hand card make both branches payable.
# AI behavior: Empty opposing board and hand provide no competing decisions.
# Failure modes: Missing labels, rejected branch, incorrect payment, or missing draws fail the observed flow.
# Card roles: Demand Answers opens the chooser; Ornithopter pays sacrifice; Grizzly Bears pays discard; Mountains pay mana; Islands count draws.
# Protocol path: Cast, CastingTimeOptionsReq, PayCostsReq or SelectNReq, and resolution zone transfers.
